name an empty limit price never buys and keeps the dialog open
remember Oil
show-buy Oil
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-Limit
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField
click Button
expect-visible FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField
expect-no-overflow
expect-text FinanceOverhaulLimitHint Enter a price
expect-orders-delta 0
expect-owned-delta Oil 0
cleanup:
close-dialog
